OL,3,GNEWSALabour loses majority after Reform
OL,4,Aby-election win
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour has lost its majority on North
OL,7,FEast Derbyshire District Council
OL,8,Ffollowing a Reform UK by-election
OL,9,Fvictory.
OL,11,FJamie Hodgson has been formally
OL,12,Fannounced as the newly-elected Reform
OL,13,Fcouncillor for the Eckington South and
OL,14,FRenishaw ward.
OL,16,FHis victory on 10 September meant
OL,17,FLabour's number of councillors dropped
OL,18,Fto 26, according to the Local Democracy
OL,19,FReporting Service (LDRS).
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
