OL,3,GNEWSALabour loses majority after Reform
OL,4,Aby-election win
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK Leader Nigel Farage hailed
OL,7,FHodgson's by-election win alongside a
OL,8,Fseparate Reform UK by-election victory
OL,9,Fthis month at North Somerset Council as
OL,10,F"brilliant Reform wins".
